Package: pulse-platform
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: Pulse Platform
Depends: libx11-6, libice6, libsm6, libfontconfig1
Description: Pulse Platform system health intelligence for verified Debian-family desktops
 Pulse discovers read-only system evidence, translates it into plain language,
 and provides safe guidance. This preview supports verified Debian, Ubuntu,
 and Linux Mint desktop systems only.
